{"id":"2c0b8291767d13ef","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-low-trivial.md","title":"Schnorr随机低性蕴含Schnorr平凡性","display":"thm-schnorr-low-trivial — Schnorr随机低性蕴含Schnorr平凡性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-low-trivial","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-low-trivial"],"display":"thm-schnorr-low-trivial — Schnorr随机低性蕴含Schnorr平凡性","depends_on":["[[43-df-lowforschnorr]]","[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","[[43-thm-lowforschnorr-char]]","[[43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char]]","[[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]","[[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.16.3.2, printed p.491 / PDF p.511","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-low-trivial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-low-trivial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-low-trivial — Schnorr随机低性蕴含Schnorr平凡性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e172de9c93804582\" href=\"?note=e172de9c93804582\" title=\"43-df-lowforschnorr\">43-df-lowforschnorr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84713a230dd071da\" href=\"?note=84713a230dd071da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-trivial\">43-df-schnorr-trivial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a11b09eb86743e34\" href=\"?note=a11b09eb86743e34\" title=\"43-thm-lowforschnorr-char\">43-thm-lowforschnorr-char</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6aad31891614c4b\" href=\"?note=b6aad31891614c4b\" title=\"43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char\">43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"31d813d8488beb16\" href=\"?note=31d813d8488beb16\" title=\"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines\">43-df-lowforcomputable-machines</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de7c59f8aed598d2\" href=\"?note=de7c59f8aed598d2\" title=\"43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.16.3.2, printed p.491 / PDF p.511"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e172de9c93804582\" href=\"?note=e172de9c93804582\" title=\"43-df-lowforschnorr\">43-df-lowforschnorr</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"84713a230dd071da\" href=\"?note=84713a230dd071da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-trivial\">43-df-schnorr-trivial</a>。机器低性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"31d813d8488beb16\" href=\"?note=31d813d8488beb16\" title=\"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines\">43-df-lowforcomputable-machines</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"de7c59f8aed598d2\" href=\"?note=de7c59f8aed598d2\" title=\"43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine\">43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine</a> 的接口；可计算可迹性的等价刻画见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a11b09eb86743e34\" href=\"?note=a11b09eb86743e34\" title=\"43-thm-lowforschnorr-char\">43-thm-lowforschnorr-char</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b6aad31891614c4b\" href=\"?note=b6aad31891614c4b\" title=\"43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char\">43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地核对书中短证明。给普通可计算机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>，构造相对机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(p)\">\\(M(p)\\)</span> 输出一个全零串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^n\">\\(0^n\\)</span> 时，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(p)=A\\upharpoonright n\">\\(L(p)=A\\upharpoonright n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 输出其他串时令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(p)=\\varnothing\">\\(L(p)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。这样 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}L=\\operatorname{dom}M\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}L=\\operatorname{dom}M\\)</span>，停机测度仍可计算，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_L(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le K_M(0^n)\">\\(K_L(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le K_M(0^n)\\)</span>。Schnorr随机低性给可计算可迹性，继而给机器低性，所以存在普通可计算机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 及常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_N(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le K_L(A\\upharpoonright n)+c\">\\(K_N(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le K_L(A\\upharpoonright n)+c\\)</span>。合并两界正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\mathrm{Sch}}0^\\omega\">\\(A\\le_{\\mathrm{Sch}}0^\\omega\\)</span>。保留全部非零输出的辅助分支是必要的：若只保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 输出全零串的程序，子域权重不一定可计算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lowforschnorr","status":"resolved","id":"e172de9c93804582","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforschnorr]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-trivial","status":"resolved","id":"84713a230dd071da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-lowforschnorr-char","status":"resolved","id":"a11b09eb86743e34","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-lowforschnorr-char]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char","status":"resolved","id":"b6aad31891614c4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-lowforcomputable-machines-char]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforcomputable-machines","status":"resolved","id":"31d813d8488beb16","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforcomputable-machines]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"de7c59f8aed598d2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-computable-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforschnorr","status":"resolved","id":"e172de9c93804582","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。机器低性采用 [[43-df-lowforcomputable-m